1.11.0 Release notes (2026-09-30)
=============================================================

### Changes

* Added `additionalQueryParameters` (`[String: String]`) to `RingPublishingGDPRConfig` via a new initializer, appended to the URL loaded by the consent form webview. Values are percent-encoded once; a parameter replaces a same-named one already in the URL. The existing initializer keeps working (no extra parameters).
